          ],
          "content": "The fourth and final state of this print was almost never printed with surface tone. As a result, not only is the interior and division of space again fully distinguishable, but the figures’ quiet immersion in their sorrow is all the more palpable."
        },
        {
          "type": "LinguisticObject",
